meta {
  name: 2i. DigitalOcean Cluster Create (DigitalOcean 클러스터 생성)
  type: http
  seq: 18
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v1/vms
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  content-type: application/json
  Idempotency-Key: {{$randomUUID}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "vmGroupName": "{{provision_cluster_name}}",
    "provider": "DIGITALOCEAN",
    "description": "DigitalOcean Droplet 기반 Kubernetes 클러스터",
    "environment": "{{provision_environment}}",
    "region": "{{provision_region}}",
    "credentialId": "{{credential_id}}",
    "spec": {
      "masterInstanceType": "{{master_vm_spec}}",
      "workerInstanceType": "{{worker_vm_spec}}",
      "workerCount": "{{worker_count}}",
      "kubernetesVersion": "{{kubernetes_version}}",
      "enableIngress": "{{enable_ingress}}",
      "enableGpuOperator": "{{enable_gpu_operator}}",
      "network": {
        "vpcCidr": "{{vpc_cidr}}",
        "podCidr": "{{pod_cidr}}",
        "serviceCidr": "{{service_cidr}}"
      }
    }
  }
}

script:post-response {
  if (res.body && res.body.data && res.body.data.id) {
    bru.setEnvVar('last_operation_id', res.body.data.id);
  }
}

tests {
  test("상태 코드 202", function() {
    expect(res.getStatus()).to.equal(202);
  });
}

docs {
  ## DigitalOcean Droplet 기반 cluster 생성

  ### Required env vars (local-digitalocean-provisioning.bru)
  - `provision_provider: DIGITALOCEAN`
  - `provision_region`: e.g. `nyc1`, `sgp1`, `fra1`
  - `credential_id`: DigitalOcean credential UUID
  - `master_vm_spec` / `worker_vm_spec`: e.g. `s-4vcpu-8gb`, `g-2vcpu-8gb`, `c-4`

  ### DigitalOcean 만의 config — **없음** (기본 K8s 공통 config 만).
  - VPC + Firewall 자동 생성 (Firewall 은 droplet 생성 후 attach)
  - 옵션: `anycloud-k8s:osImage` — DO image slug (예: `ubuntu-22-04-x64`)
  - Spot/preemptible 미지원

  ### 실행
  ```bash
  bru run "VM Cluster (VM 클러스터)/2i. DigitalOcean Cluster Create (DigitalOcean 클러스터 생성).bru" \
      --env local-digitalocean-provisioning
  ```
}
